<p>The pattern inside the circle should be oriented as shown above.  The ASCII map below assumes you have done this already and that you have placed the Parts HD in the correct position.  The Sun Giant has just enough room to fit inside the factory when positioned correctly.  The PartsH D, when placed in the correct position will not be at the very top and center of the circle, this is the upper limit of the factory floor.  The raised platform with the ramp at the bottom of the circle is the lower limit of the factory floor.</p>
